---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="text-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>ELSEWHERE ARCHIVE</h1>
    <p>ELSEWHERE ARCHIVE is an evolving artwork and archive. It emerged from <a class="external" href="https://endsafter.ch" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">ENDSAFTER ↗</a> and is initiated by <a class="external" href="https://ibulla.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">iBulla ↗</a>.</p>
    <p>Contributors add postcard-sized works associated with different places. Each entry is registered with a permanent archive identifier and ISO country code; physical editions form a growing archive.</p>
    <p>The archive explores place, origin, association, distance and the idea of “elsewhere”. Edition 01 begins in 2026.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
